# The notes repo holds text: reports, handoffs, briefs, kb docs, small evidence (patches, scripts, logs, JSON).
# Proof dumps, binaries and archives belong in the research store (`research data put ... --preserve`, cite the art: id).
# `research notes snapshot` also skips any file over 1 MB.
*.proof
*.stmt
*.neg
*.bin
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.so
*.o
*.tgz
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.gz
*.zst
*.xz
*.zip
*.sqlite
*.db
.inbox-seen
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
# git data of any repository never goes in notes: code moves only through verity branches; a bundle a VM cannot push goes in
# the Verity Project store's top-level artifacts/ (not mirrored). 14 bundles of the private verity repo were found here, 2026-09-27.
*.bundle
*.pack
*.idx
*.rev
*.keep
packed-refs
.git/
